# NAME: OKX Direct
# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET (policy omitted)
# SOURCE: local gateway traffic observation, 2026-08-14 to 2026-08-18
# MIRROR: Graham-lo/surge
# UPDATED: 2026-08-18
# NOTE: OKX endpoints that must bypass the proxy. The .cn and jingyunyilian hosts sit on
# China Unicom and measured 140-147 ms proxied against 24-29 ms direct. The
# gihiji aliases resolve into the same Hong Kong range as the IP entries below.
# Reference this set with the DIRECT policy immediately before OKX.list.

# Domestic hosts on China Unicom.
DOMAIN,fjcwcapp.yqtjc.cn
DOMAIN,mdcvsca.yqtjc.cn
DOMAIN,mapp.nqjwzm.cn
DOMAIN,static.jingyunyilian.com

# Regional aliases.
DOMAIN,www.gihiji.com.eo.dnse4.com
DOMAIN,wspri.gihiji.com.eo.dnse4.com
DOMAIN,wsdexpri.gihiji.com.eo.dnse4.com

# Acceleration addresses behind those aliases.
IP-CIDR,43.168.20.5/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.168.20.6/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.168.24.31/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.168.24.35/32,no-resolve
